# Calendar: formatting, components, construction, and arithmetic over a UTC timestamp (epoch milliseconds, an integer). The clean uniform interface; the per-env native implementation is selected at build time and hidden. Each platform delegates to its best date library (node / browser the host Date, rust chrono, swift Foundation, kotlin java.time). Everything is UTC, so results are deterministic across hosts. Formatting and parsing use ISO 8601 with millisecond precision and a Z suffix (2026-06-19T12:34:56.000Z). Fixed-length units (second / minute / hour / day) are pure integer arithmetic on the timestamp; calendar-aware units (month / year) delegate to the platform, which handles month lengths and leap years.

load @term/seed/code/native/calendar
  find do-format
  find do-parse
  find do-year
  find do-month
  find do-day
  find do-hour
  find do-minute
  find do-second
  find do-weekday
  find do-build
  find do-add-months
  find do-add-years

form date-parts
  link year, like integer
  link month, like integer
  link day, like integer
  link hour, like integer
  link minute, like integer
  link second, like integer
  link weekday, like integer

task format
  take millis, like number
  like text
  send back, call do-format, read millis

task parse
  take text, like text
  like number
  send back, call do-parse, read text

task year
  take millis, like number
  like integer
  send back, call do-year, read millis

task month
  take millis, like number
  like integer
  send back, call do-month, read millis

task day
  take millis, like number
  like integer
  send back, call do-day, read millis

task hour
  take millis, like number
  like integer
  send back, call do-hour, read millis

task minute
  take millis, like number
  like integer
  send back, call do-minute, read millis

task second
  take millis, like number
  like integer
  send back, call do-second, read millis

task weekday
  take millis, like number
  like integer
  send back, call do-weekday, read millis

task make-utc
  take year, like integer
  take month, like integer
  take day, like integer
  take hour, like integer
  take minute, like integer
  take second, like integer
  like number
  send back
    call do-build
      read year
      read month
      read day
      read hour
      read minute
      read second

task to-parts
  take millis, like number
  like date-parts
  send back
    make date-parts
      bind year, call year, read millis
      bind month, call month, read millis
      bind day, call day, read millis
      bind hour, call hour, read millis
      bind minute, call minute, read millis
      bind second, call second, read millis
      bind weekday, call weekday, read millis

task add-seconds
  take millis, like number
  take count, like number
  like number
  send back
    call add
      read millis
      call multiply
        read count
        code 1000

task add-minutes
  take millis, like number
  take count, like number
  like number
  send back
    call add
      read millis
      call multiply
        read count
        code 60000

task add-hours
  take millis, like number
  take count, like number
  like number
  send back
    call add
      read millis
      call multiply
        read count
        code 3600000

task add-days
  take millis, like number
  take count, like number
  like number
  send back
    call add
      read millis
      call multiply
        read count
        code 86400000

task add-months
  take millis, like number
  take count, like number
  like number
  send back
    call do-add-months
      read millis
      read count

task add-years
  take millis, like number
  take count, like number
  like number
  send back
    call do-add-years
      read millis
      read count
